WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.222 --> 00:00:05.222
("Blonde")
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.905 --> 00:00:11.404
♪ Whisper in my ear ♪

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:14.995
♪ Take away all my fear ♪

00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:18.620
♪ Lay here through the night ♪

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.220
♪ Drink with me until it's light ♪

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.510
♪ Hold me ♪

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:29.510
♪ Don't leave me lonely tonight ♪

00:00:32.771 --> 00:00:36.958
♪ Tonight ♪

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.409
♪ You move across the floor ♪

00:00:40.409 --> 00:00:42.239
♪ Away from me ♪

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:44.046
♪ Toward the door ♪

00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:45.806
♪ In my head ♪

00:00:45.806 --> 00:00:47.379
♪ I grab your wrist ♪

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:49.500
♪ You crash back to me ♪

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.968
♪ With a kiss ♪

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:53.961
♪ If only ♪

00:00:53.961 --> 00:00:58.209
♪ You could hold me ♪

00:00:58.209 --> 00:01:03.209
♪ Tonight ♪

00:01:03.768 --> 00:01:05.800
♪ Woo! ♪

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.593
♪ Lay here ♪

00:01:08.593 --> 00:01:12.663
♪ Can't you stay here, stay here ♪

00:01:12.663 --> 00:01:17.663
♪ The way you change the dark to light ♪

00:01:20.408 --> 00:01:23.377
♪ Save me, save me ♪

00:01:23.377 --> 00:01:26.895
♪ What you gave me, gave me ♪

00:01:26.895 --> 00:01:31.895
♪ Is safety from the darkest night ♪

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.493
♪ Oh, if only ♪

00:01:37.691 --> 00:01:40.142
(audience cheering)

